i Major 2024.\n<br>\n<br>\nHousing 20 esports athletes competing in some of the biggest esports titles, such as Dota 2, Counter-Strike 2, PUBG, Mobile Legends: BB, and Hearthstone, Team Spirit is dedicated to performing consistently at top-level events around the globe.","btn_title":"SHOP NOW","btn_link":"\/products\/blacklyte-athena-pro-gaming-chair?variant=46846303011065"}},"slick_item_cCcwMw":{"type":"slickItem","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_slick_1.webp","title":"Precision Embroidery","text":"Blacklyte’s custom embroidery is crafted with over 100,000 precision stitches, delivering exceptional depth, clarity, and long-lasting definition. Every detail reflects our commitment to craftsmanship, durability, and refined performance—designed to look sharp and stay sharp over time."}},"slick_item_AtMnTB":{"type":"slickItem","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_slick_2.webp","title":"Premium Materials","text":"From the surface you touch to the structure beneath, every material is carefully selected for performance and longevity. The chair features next-generation eco leatherette that delivers a luxury feel comparable to premium leather, while offering enhanced durability and sustainability. Paired with ultra-soft memory foam and a reinforced internal structure, it achieves the perfect balance of comfort, strength, and endurance."}},"slick_item_yJCQx6":{"type":"slickItem","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_slick_4.webp","title":"4-Way Dynamic Armrests","text":"Engineered for precision and adaptability, Blacklyte’s 4-Way Dynamic Armrests move seamlessly in multiple directions to support your natural posture. By aligning your arms, shoulders, and wrists correctly, they help reduce muscle strain and joint stress—keeping you comfortable, focused, and supported through long gaming or work sessions."}},"slick_item_kAFQhG":{"type":"slickItem","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_slick_3.webp","title":"Adjustable Lumbar Support","text":"The integrated 4-Way Dynamic Lumbar Support is the core of superior seating comfort. With adjustable height and depth, it conforms precisely to your spine, delivering personalized support where it matters most. Enhanced with memory foam in the backrest, it provides lasting comfort and stability—ideal for extended periods of sitting without fatigue."}},"achievements_rdUXQF":{"type":"achievements","settings":{"title":"A LEGACY REIMAGINED","text":"A masterpiece of lightweight engineering and uncompromising design. With precision-crafted structure and premium materials, every Blacklyte Edition Chair represents top-tier craftsmanship and exceptional performance.","left_image_title":"","right_image_title":""}}},"block_order":["team_awT8Gj","slick_item_cCcwMw","slick_item_AtMnTB","slick_item_yJCQx6","slick_item_kAFQhG","achievements_rdUXQF"],"name":"joint spirit team","settings":{}},"joint_spirit_highlights_LpTwmt":{"type":"joint-spirit-highlights","blocks":{"swiper_item_9VzKkz":{"type":"swiper_item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_scene_1.webp"}},"swiper_item_MmyNAT":{"type":"swiper_item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_scene_2.webp"}},"swiper_item_YPWVLF":{"type":"swiper_item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_scene_3.webp"}},"swiper_item_DnBAg9":{"type":"swiper_item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_scene_4.webp"}},"swiper_item_icAFHk":{"type":"swiper_item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_scene_5.webp"}}},"block_order":["swiper_item_9VzKkz","swiper_item_MmyNAT","swiper_item_YPWVLF","swiper_item_DnBAg9","swiper_item_icAFHk"],"name":"joint spirit highlights","settings":{"background_img":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/joint_spirit_highlights_bg.webp","title":"ELEGANCE THAT DEMANDS A SECOND GLANCE","text":"Designed to captivate at first sight, this chair balances clean lines, sculpted form, and p